			<!--Main Content start-->We believe caring for our patients is a privilege. That's why the team at Winnie Palmer Hospital is here to deliver the most advanced range of care to anticipate, and go beyond, your needs. In the next day, we'll give you a call to confirm a day and time that works for your calendar.<!--Main Content end--><br />
